1
00:00:01,793 --> 00:00:06,889
A Mountain Elementary School.

2
00:00:09,815 --> 00:00:22,438
We visit <color=orange><b>boarding school</b></color> at Sung Thai commune.

3
00:00:23,889 --> 00:00:40,509
Student Sung To Dinh, troop leader, leads us to visit school.

4
00:00:41,320 --> 00:00:50,334
School has enough classrooms for five grades, has kitchen, dining room and dormitory.

5
00:00:51,244 --> 00:01:01,435
Student Dinh says: Morning we study in class, afternoon do homework.

6
00:01:02,443 --> 00:01:16,943
Outside class hours, we sing dance, play sports or grow vegetables, raise chickens to improve meals.

7
00:01:17,220 --> 00:01:25,125
According to Dinh, although missing home, at school very happy.

8
00:01:25,225 --> 00:01:39,605
Going home, everyone looks forward to Monday soon to meet again.

